	Abstract = {We describe a sample of K giants at the South Galactic Pole, selected to examine the chemical and kinematical properties of stars perpendicular to the galactic plane and to measure the local column density of the disk. We report velocities, abundances, absolute magnitudes, and broadband BV photometry for over 500 giants.},
